# Workstreams, merge & deploy

## Branch naming

`cursor/<workstream>-<task>-<suffix>` — one unrelated topic per branch/PR.

## Development

- Plan before new features; small commits; do not rebuild apps until features complete.
- Protect the default branch (`main` or `master`): **port/integrate**, do not overwrite working code.
- Logs: `docs/agent-log/<workstream>/`
- Scratch: `artifacts/<workstream>/` (gitignored)

## Merge + deploy loop

1. Push branch → PR → merge to default branch → deploy (if live) → verify → agent log → tell user what is live.

GluX Workers/theme deploy details (when applicable): monorepo `Hristos0527/linx-presentation-site` → `docs/AGENT_OPERATIONS.md`.

## Repo moves / renames

Port **all** behaviour before deleting old paths. Merge or document superseded branches in agent log.
